	 (5,'2025-09-08 10:35:33',3,'Whatsapp Patcher Zero-Click Exploit Targetting IOS and MacOS Devices','<p><img src="https://drive.poltekssn.ac.id/apps/files_sharing/publicpreview/Lcibb7SAfkBmBip?file=/&amp;fileId=3636830&amp;x=2560&amp;y=1440&amp;a=true&amp;etag=d1192611724ba4a1877e7222d842bb50" alt="" width="824" height="966" /></p>
